  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with an e→ie stem change in the stressed syllables: presente (all but nosotros/nosotras), subjuntivo presente (all but nosotros/nosotras), and imperativo afirmativo tú/usted/ustedes forms. Nosotros/nosotras always reverts to the unstressed stem (encomendamos, encomendemos).",
    "Past participle is regular: **encomendado**.",
    "*Al Juzgado se le encomienda la investigación.* (\"The Court is entrusted with the investigation.\")",
    "*Le encomendaron la tarea más difícil.* (\"They assigned him/her the hardest task.\")",
    "Related: *la encomienda* (assignment/parcel, noun), *encargar* (near-synonym, \"to entrust/order\"), *confiar* (broader synonym, \"to trust\")."
  ],
